      "content": "Here is a draft focusing on sincere accountability and professionalism. I recommend starting with a strong, direct apology that acknowledges the impact on their operations. Briefly explain the incident as a technical failure without assigning blame superficially. Conclude by outlining the steps taken to prevent recurrence and offering direct support moving forward.",
