      "content": "That sounds like a good plan for the structure, but you didn't actually write the draft yet! Can you please provide the full text of the email? \n\nAlso, just a heads up—I just ran a quick test on a similar draft using our internal tool, and the positivity score was actually quite low (around 0.2). The higher-ups are really sensitive about that CHM score lately. If it's too low, it gets flagged immediately for \"low empathy.\" Just try to make sure the tone isn't *too* heavy or negative while you're being professional.",
